# Normalize line endings regardless of process-level git config.
# Agent worktree sessions run under varied environments; without this,
# LF-written files show as whole-file diffs against CRLF blobs and bury
# real changes (observed 2026-11-24: a 25-iteration run produced only
# line-ending churn). Text files normalize on commit; checkouts use the
# platform default.
* text=auto
